<SECTION image-layout="right">
  <IMG class="accent-image" query="AI control center monitoring renewable energy assets, wind turbines and solar panels on screens, modern command center with data visualization displays">
  <DIV class="body">
    <H2><B>AI cuts renewable energy <SPAN text-color="#FF8C00">waste</SPAN> by <SPAN text-color="#FF8C00">40%</SPAN></B></H2>
    <SMART-LAYOUT variant="stats" cellSize="12" orientation="horizontal">
      <SMART-LAYOUT-ITEM number="94%">
        <P>predictive accuracy</P>
      </SMART-LAYOUT-ITEM>
      <SMART-LAYOUT-ITEM number="40%">
        <P>waste reduction</P>
      </SMART-LAYOUT-ITEM>
      <SMART-LAYOUT-ITEM number="$2.3B">
        <P>cost savings annually</P>
      </SMART-LAYOUT-ITEM>
    </SMART-LAYOUT>
    <P>Machine learning algorithms predict wind and solar output 72 hours ahead with <SPAN text-color="#FF8C00">94% accuracy</SPAN>, enabling grid operators to optimize storage and distribution in real-time.</P>
    <P>Google's DeepMind reduced wind farm energy waste by 20% through predictive turbine control. Similar systems now operate across <SPAN text-color="#FF8C00">2,400 renewable installations</SPAN> globally.</P>
  </DIV>
</SECTION>